Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:56:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ADD focused-pane visual yanks so terminal users can copy
 selected text

Terminal command mode uses visual selections in the focused pane for character, line, and block ranges. The selection state tracks its anchor separately from cursor movement so yanks and highlighting stay stable, including block selections that cross shorter lines.
